{"PageNumber":306,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":12,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يَٰيَحۡيَىٰ خُذِ ٱلۡكِتَٰبَ بِقُوَّةٖۖ وَءَاتَيۡنَٰهُ ٱلۡحُكۡمَ صَبِيّٗا","TajweedText":"يَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>يَحْيَىٰ خُذِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكِتَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بَ بِقُوَّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةٍ‌ۖ و</tajweed>َءَاتَيْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحُكْمَ صَبِيًّا <span class=end>١٢</span>","End":"١٢","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":264,"MaqraNumber":122,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":13,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَحَنَانٗا مِّن لَّدُنَّا وَزَكَوٰةٗۖ وَكَانَ تَقِيّٗا","TajweedText":"وَحَنَا<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>نًا م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ل</tajweed>َّدُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا وَزَكَ<tajweed class=slnt>و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>ٲ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً‌ۖ و</tajweed>َكَانَ تَقِيًّا <span class=end>١٣</span>","End":"١٣","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":264,"MaqraNumber":122,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":14,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَبَرَّۢا بِوَٰلِدَيۡهِ وَلَمۡ يَكُن جَبَّارًا عَصِيّٗا","TajweedText":"وَبَرّ<tajweed class=iqlab>َۢا ب</tajweed>ِو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِدَيْهِ وَلَمْ يَكُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ج</tajweed>َبَّارًا عَصِيًّا <span class=end>١٤</span>","End":"١٤","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":264,"MaqraNumber":122,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":15,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَسَلَٰمٌ عَلَيۡهِ يَوۡمَ وُلِدَ وَيَوۡمَ يَمُوتُ وَيَوۡمَ يُبۡعَثُ حَيّٗا","TajweedText":"وَسَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>مٌ عَلَيْهِ يَوْمَ وُلِدَ وَيَوْمَ يَمُوتُ وَيَوْمَ يُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>عَثُ حَيًّا <span class=end>١٥</span>","End":"١٥","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":264,"MaqraNumber":122,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":16,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱذۡكُرۡ فِي ٱلۡكِتَٰبِ مَرۡيَمَ إِذِ ٱنتَبَذَتۡ مِنۡ أَهۡلِهَا مَكَانٗا شَرۡقِيّٗا","TajweedText":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>ذْكُرْ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكِتَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بِ مَرْيَمَ إِذِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>َبَذَتْ مِنْ أَهْلِهَا مَكَا<tajweed class=ikhafa>نًا ش</tajweed>َرْقِيًّا <span class=end>١٦</span>","End":"١٦","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":265,"MaqraNumber":122,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":17,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَٱتَّخَذَتۡ مِن دُونِهِمۡ حِجَابٗا فَأَرۡسَلۡنَآ إِلَيۡهَا رُوحَنَا فَتَمَثَّلَ لَهَا بَشَرٗا سَوِيّٗا","TajweedText":"فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّخَذَتْ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن د</tajweed>ُونِهِمْ حِجَا<tajweed class=ikhafa>بًا ف</tajweed>َأَرْسَلْن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَيْهَا رُوحَنَا فَتَمَثَّلَ لَهَا بَشَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>رًا س</tajweed>َوِيًّا <span class=end>١٧</span>","End":"١٧","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":265,"MaqraNumber":122,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":18,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَتۡ إِنِّيٓ أَعُوذُ بِٱلرَّحۡمَٰنِ مِنكَ إِن كُنتَ تَقِيّٗا","TajweedText":"قَالَتْ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> أَعُوذُ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رَّحْمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نِ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نك</tajweed>َ إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>َ تَقِيًّا <span class=end>١٨</span>","End":"١٨","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":265,"MaqraNumber":122,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":19,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ إِنَّمَآ أَنَا۠ رَسُولُ رَبِّكِ لِأَهَبَ لَكِ غُلَٰمٗا زَكِيّٗا","TajweedText":"قَالَ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَنَا۟ رَسُولُ رَبِّكِ لِأَهَبَ لَكِ غُلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>مًا ز</tajweed>َكِيًّا <span class=end>١٩</span>","End":"١٩","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":265,"MaqraNumber":122,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":20,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَتۡ أَنَّىٰ يَكُونُ لِي غُلَٰمٞ وَلَمۡ يَمۡسَسۡنِي بَشَرٞ وَلَمۡ أَكُ بَغِيّٗا","TajweedText":"قَالَتْ أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َىٰ يَكُونُ لِى غُلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مٌ و</tajweed>َلَمْ يَمْسَسْنِى بَشَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٌ و</tajweed>َلَمْ أَكُ بَغِيًّا <span class=end>٢٠</span>","End":"٢٠","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":265,"MaqraNumber":122,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":21,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ كَذَٰلِكِ قَالَ رَبُّكِ هُوَ عَلَيَّ هَيِّنٞۖ وَلِنَجۡعَلَهُۥٓ ءَايَةٗ لِّلنَّاسِ وَرَحۡمَةٗ مِّنَّاۚ وَكَانَ أَمۡرٗا مَّقۡضِيّٗا","TajweedText":"قَالَ كَذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكِ قَالَ رَبُّكِ هُوَ عَلَىَّ هَيِّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>نٌ‌ۖ و</tajweed>َلِنَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>عَلَهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ</tajweed> ءَايَ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ةً ل</tajweed>ِّل<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َاسِ وَرَحْمَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً م</tajweed>ِّ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا‌ۚ وَكَانَ أَمْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رًا م</tajweed>َّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>ضِيًّا <span class=end>٢١</span>","End":"٢١","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":265,"MaqraNumber":122,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":22,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"۞فَحَمَلَتۡهُ فَٱنتَبَذَتۡ بِهِۦ مَكَانٗا قَصِيّٗا","TajweedText":"۞ فَحَمَلَتْهُ فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>َبَذَتْ بِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> مَكَا<tajweed class=ikhafa>نًا ق</tajweed>َصِيًّا <span class=end>٢٢</span>","End":"٢٢","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":265,"MaqraNumber":123,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":23,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَأَجَآءَهَا ٱلۡمَخَاضُ إِلَىٰ جِذۡعِ ٱلنَّخۡلَةِ قَالَتۡ يَٰلَيۡتَنِي مِتُّ قَبۡلَ هَٰذَا وَكُنتُ نَسۡيٗا مَّنسِيّٗا","TajweedText":"فَأَج<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَهَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَخَاضُ إِلَىٰ جِذْعِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َخْلَةِ قَالَتْ يَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لَيْتَنِى مِتُّ قَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لَ هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذَا وَكُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُ نَسْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>يًا م</tajweed>َّ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نس</tajweed>ِيًّا <span class=end>٢٣</span>","End":"٢٣","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":265,"MaqraNumber":123,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":24,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَنَادَىٰهَا مِن تَحۡتِهَآ أَلَّا تَحۡزَنِي قَدۡ جَعَلَ رَبُّكِ تَحۡتَكِ سَرِيّٗا","TajweedText":"فَنَادَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ٮٰ</tajweed>هَا مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ت</tajweed>َحْتِه<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَلَّا تَحْزَنِى قَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed> جَعَلَ رَبُّكِ تَحْتَكِ سَرِيًّا <span class=end>٢٤</span>","End":"٢٤","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":265,"MaqraNumber":123,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":25,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَهُزِّيٓ إِلَيۡكِ بِجِذۡعِ ٱلنَّخۡلَةِ تُسَٰقِطۡ عَلَيۡكِ رُطَبٗا جَنِيّٗا","TajweedText":"وَهُزّ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> إِلَيْكِ بِجِذْعِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َخْلَةِ تُسَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>قِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>طْ</tajweed> عَلَيْكِ رُطَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>بًا ج</tajweed>َنِيًّا <span class=end>٢٥</span>","End":"٢٥","PageNumber":306,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":265,"MaqraNumber":123,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false}]}